  customerName: A Former Route Keeper
  request: Pack the lantern, map, and seal. Keep the seal beside the lantern. Add
    Magical Protection, it remembers a route we closed...
  storyId: former-route-keeper
  firstVisitStory: "That parcel beneath your counter. May I see the tag?\n\n\u201CNot
    yet.\u201D We used that instead of a date on the cemetery route. It meant the
    recipient wasn\u2019t ready to receive it.\n\nI carried that route until they
    closed it. This lantern still lights itself every night.\n\nSend it to the last
    postmaster. Perhaps he knows who\u2019s making deliveries."
  recipient: The Last Postmaster
